{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/a0a9ca97bcfb5f4890ab497de44042f1.poster.avif?t=1763396959\" width=616 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/a0a9ca97bcfb5f4890ab497de44042f1.webm?t=1763396959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Awaken in a world torn by corruption. <strong>Gather your heroes, forge your deck, and fight against the dark forces devouring the Kingdom of Olimoria.</strong> Each journey is unique: with every step, forgotten secrets emerge, uncertain alliances are formed, and new abilities arise as the last defense against the spreading evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/9e459a770884faee9494b20ab4e3a856.webp?t=1763396959\" width=620 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/72341183c552ea71b74d2cbccac3bb0e.poster.avif?t=1763396959\" width=598 height=259 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/72341183c552ea71b74d2cbccac3bb0e.webm?t=1763396959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Mage masters forbidden magic, the Paladin carries the last glimmer of light, and the Rogue walks in the shadows. Learn their abilities, combine their powers, and discover new ways to face the chaos. <strong>But they are only the beginning of your journey.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>A dark and unforgettable Roguelike Deckbuilder.</strong>No two journeys are the same. No victory is guaranteed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Evolving World and Characters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face relentless enemies, experience unpredictable events, and uncover fragments of a story shrouded in mystery. Along the way, find enigmatic allies who can help you grow, even if their true intentions remain hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/22f4602568eff0a39900dadf9884263f.webp?t=1763396959\" width=616 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/ad09f8b1e0d20f59fca5e31d2a022894.poster.avif?t=1763396959\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/ad09f8b1e0d20f59fca5e31d2a022894.webm?t=1763396959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/ad09f8b1e0d20f59fca5e31d2a022894.mp4?t=1763396959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Strategic Deck Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every card you choose shapes the course of your adventure. Select cards that synergize with your party's composition. Train with enigmatic mentors and <strong>prepare to face increasingly intense challenges as corruption spreads.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/b7cfa2e5cd092aad83f2385372040d80.webp?t=1763396959\" width=616 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/b940f17af7b1079801c26463d60ec2e4.poster.avif?t=1763396959\" width=616 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/b940f17af7b1079801c26463d60ec2e4.webm?t=1763396959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">30+ unique cards per character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/ff9837aea55ec86679b21597fdbe639c.webp?t=1763396959\" width=616 height=39 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/8b315cf337a948471c643ef75cdad033.poster.avif?t=1763396959\" width=610 height=297 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3942630/extras/8b315cf337a948471c643ef75cdad033.webm?t=1763396959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Beyond the initial heroes, the shadows hide powerful champions who have yet to awaken.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/ima